Package: windsoropendata
Title: Read City of Windsor Open Data in R
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Umair", "Durrani", email = "umair@durrani.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A thin wrapper around the 'arcgislayers' package for the City of
    Windsor open data portal. The portal is an ArcGIS Hub site backed by the
    City's own ArcGIS Server at mappmycity.ca. This package lists the
    available datasets, searches them by name, and reads a dataset by its
    short name instead of its full ArcGIS REST URL. It also reads the
    Windsor Police Service Incident Dashboard, a separate public ArcGIS
    FeatureServer, with windsor_police_incidents(), and live traffic
    speeds and incidents from the TomTom Traffic API, with
    windsor_tomtom_flow() and windsor_tomtom_incidents(), which need a
    free TomTom API key in the TOMTOM_API_KEY environment variable.
